# Top-level dependencies — the compiled, hash-locked file is
# api/requirements.lock (uv pip compile --generate-hashes). A PyPI release
# compromise (ultralytics-style, Dec 2024) cannot ship silently: pip
# refuses any artifact whose hash isn't in the lock. Regenerate:
#   uv pip compile api/requirements.in --generate-hashes -o api/requirements.lock
